|  One special feature of family courts, particularly when sex abuse allegations are involved, is the special roster of auxiliary actors: law
|  guardians, Child Protective Services (CPS) caseworkers, visitation supervisors, court-appointed mental health experts and evaluators, and
.  sometimes others

